 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Constant sheaves are acyclic on irreducible Noetherian spaces",
 "statement": "Let X be an irreducible Noetherian topological space (meaning every nonempty set of closed subsets has a minimal element for inclusion) and let A be an abelian group. For the constant abelian sheaf A_X on X [def-weil-pbc-constant-sheaf], H^q(X,A_X)=0 for every integer q>0 [def-sc-topological-abelian-cohomology].",
